[options]
[A.]
        <h2>A taste of Freedom~.<a href="#mission21">~[IfortGump.46]</a></h2>
You have a choice of what you may start the mission with. You may pick one
 selection from the Allies' Ability, and one selection from the Enemie's Ability.
 <p>
 You only have 1 chance! Good luck!
$Menu=*****~[Iflag.5] Allies' ABILITY ~[Iflag.5]*****,Tell,A.
$Menu=~[Inugget.2]<?{sw_mvar0}>~y</?>     More Storm Power     ~[Inugget.2],Tell,morePower
$Menu=~[Iburied.0]<?{sw_mvar2}>~y</?>            A Few Spells            ~[Iburied.0],Tell,spells
$Menu=~[Ibridge.44]<?{sw_mvar1}>~y</?>          Crack all Bridges           ~[Ibridge.44],Tell,collectMore

$Menu=     ,Tell,A.
$Menu=*****~[Iflag.5] Enemies' ABILITY ~[Iflag.5]*****,Tell,A.
$Menu=~[Inugget.2]<?{sw_mvar3}>~y</?>     Less Storm Power     ~[Inugget.2],Tell,lessPower
$Menu=~[IsunWalker.52]<?{sw_mvar4}>~y</?>          Collect Less           ~[IsunWalker.16],Tell,collectLess
$Menu=~[Ipriest.16]<?{sw_mvar6}>~y</?>     Slower Movement     ~[Ipriest.40],Tell,priestSlower
$Menu=~[Ibridge.18]<?{sw_mvar5}>~y</?>           Bridge Slower            ~[Ibridge.18],Tell,bridgeSlower

$Button=OK I made my Choice. This is what I want,Tell,choiceDone



